rill and excitement of \u201cNinja Warrior\u201d come alive in VR!\nUse every bit of your strength, balance, and reflexes to conquer intense obstacle courses through full-body motion."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u6a2a\u9577\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_2560\u00d71440px.png", "id": "4206557512967114", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619098_4206557516300447_943281957663249977_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CvVNADhmjmAQ7kNvwFiB7UJ&_nc_oc=AdrzMjRBb7i12piJuHgHe01jZivG0UR01o6kHospiTA6JSh4kGwbHbzorI7C2yS0S6s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSLZ8gKmzBWgy6IA5eu8-IlG75UktDYK2p117Me-b_bUQ&oe=6B0B256F"}, {"file_name": "\u30d2\u30fc\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_3000\u00d7900px.png", "id": "2975615619303809", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619774_2975615622637142_1331376706207959328_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n3P-qDDJbSUQ7kNvwE9YYay&_nc_oc=AdoY4162dvnM8Yx38UgJjyzkVmrOApVkXodSGfO7iwOkQq6ZK4Cz2V1a7C1eLb4Zhz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR1AGp7HntaaAfa5aJtj5IiSkR17YNyzSVkIxOuF_nr4A&oe=6B0B375A"}, {"file_name": "\u7e26\u9577\u306e\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_1008\u00d71440px.png", "id": "1459347908497843", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_1459347911831176_5240984296618367253_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fiQhcyKpYkYQ7kNvwEyf2Kv&_nc_oc=AdpqAOdDUO--q4Fb7qFCs3jMw3HAiu1sAeqoo74KrCgnX2JbJJNfjhW7rkkUYUV5rlI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSoSZhXy8QRIF-LDO1vqdztJY51wPFHtbvelZp3TJxerA&oe=6B0B1C7C"}, {"file_name": "\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3_512\u00d7512px.png", "id": "1182588407080721", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scon